secubox-authelia (1.0.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Authelia SSO IdP in LXC at 10.100.0.20.
  * File backend reading /etc/secubox/users.json (argon2 — matches Authelia spec).
